lede = "{frozen_buildings} structures in {city} have gone below the temperature at which they do anything at all."
body = "Frozen is not slow. Frozen is a machine with ice inside the housing and a crew standing next to it with their hands under their arms.

It does not come back on its own. Heat has to reach it, and heat is reaching it through the same pipes that are the reason it froze."
